  "html": "<h1 class=\"dance-show-title\">Pigeon on the Jetway</h1>\n<p class=\"dance-show-hook\">hook: <u>hey</u> to diagonal <u>hey</u> to ricochet <u>hey</u> chase sequence</h2>\n      \n<p class=\"dance-show-choreographer\">by: <strong><a href=\"/choreographers/413\">Koren Wake</a></strong></p>\n<p class=\"dance-show-formation\">formation: Becket double progression </p>\n<div class=\"dance-show-preamble\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'></div></div>\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-condensed contra-table-nonfluid\">\n         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>A1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">long lines forward &amp; back</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">gentlespoons allemande left once</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td>A2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners gyre 1½</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">ladles start a half hey - lefts in center, rights on ends, look to the right diagonal ⁋</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>B1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">ladles start a right diagonal half hey - lefts in center, rights on ends, look straight across ⁋</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">ladles start a half hey - lefts in center, rights on ends  - ladles ricochet, gentlespoons ricochet</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 dance-show-long-figure\">\n             <td>B2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>16</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners balance &amp; swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr></table>\n<div class=\"dance-show-notes\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'><p>See notes &amp; more readable choreography here:<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.korenwake.com/choreography#h.h5lwwkya238h\">https://www.korenwake.com/choreography#h.h5lwwkya238h</a></p>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"dance-show-publish\">\n            shared everywhere\n          </p>\n"
